        "abstract": "The 1974 International Conference on Noise Control Engineering was held as scheduled in Washington, DC, on 30 September - 2 October 1974. We are pleased to report that from all indications, INTER-NOISE 74 was a most successful venture. Some 800 engineers and individuals concerned with noise control attended the Conference, and 95 of these were from fifteen countries other than the United States! The enclosed materials document the activities at INTER-NOISE 74.",
